# @centos: the mirrors dnf uses in a CentOS Stream egress session, once
# os/centos/manifest.sh has pointed the repos at them. The RiotBox image is
# CentOS Stream 10 with CRB and EPEL enabled. docs/dev/os-contract.md.
# Source: https://mirror.stream.centos.org/ (the CentOS Stream mirror; the baseurl of baseos,
# appstream, crb and extras-common)
mirror.stream.centos.org
# Source: https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Infrastructure/Mirroring (dl.fedoraproject.org, the
# master mirror; the baseurl os/centos/manifest.sh sets for epel)
dl.fedoraproject.org
